.TH T_TRTEST 1.SH NAMEt_trtest \- test the RICO tree trap handler.SH SYNOPSIS\fBt_trtest\fR.SH DESCRIPTIONAn exerciser for the tree-search routines of the RICO trap library fromEFFO forum disk 7.  It prompts\fBline (or .):\fR,\fRprints what the tree search found for the line typed\fR(\fBtree_srch=\fR),\fRand asks\fBadd?\fR;\fRa line holding only a dot ends it.  At the end of its input it keepsprompting, so type the dot.